{"id":"66db32701f08d60a","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dim-weak-srandom.md","title":"弱 s 随机的复杂度刻画","display":"thm-dim-weak-srandom — 弱 s 随机的复杂度刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dim-weak-srandom","aliases":["43-thm-dim-weak-srandom"],"display":"thm-dim-weak-srandom — 弱 s 随机的复杂度刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-weak-srandom]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Thm.17.4.2, printed pp.518–519 / PDF pp.538–539","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dim-weak-srandom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dim-weak-srandom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dim-weak-srandom — 弱 s 随机的复杂度刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a1fddb2090fe6a3d\" href=\"?note=a1fddb2090fe6a3d\" title=\"43-df-weak-srandom\">43-df-weak-srandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thm.17.4.2, printed pp.518–519 / PDF pp.538–539"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a1fddb2090fe6a3d\" href=\"?note=a1fddb2090fe6a3d\" title=\"43-df-weak-srandom\">43-df-weak-srandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakSRandom}_s(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,[K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge sn-c].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WeakSRandom}_s(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,[K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge sn-c].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补足 Tadaki 的精确常数下界；不可仅换成 dim_H(X)≥s，因为临界 s 的常数亏损有额外内容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-weak-srandom","status":"resolved","id":"a1fddb2090fe6a3d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-weak-srandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-weak-srandom","status":"resolved","id":"a1fddb2090fe6a3d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-weak-srandom]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；见 [[43-df-weak-srandom]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakSRandom}_s(X)\\iff\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,[K(X\\upharpoonright n)\\ge sn-c].","display":true}],"bytes":1088,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-453","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dim-weak-srandom]] — 弱 s 随机的复杂度刻画"}],"outgoing":["a1fddb2090fe6a3d","6cd902d852c2c848"]}